{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":52,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["錫安必獲救"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["錫安啊，醒來吧，醒來吧，展示你的能力！",{"text":"聖城耶路撒冷啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"穿上你華美的衣服！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從今以後，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"未受割禮和不潔淨的人必不得再進城。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷啊，抖掉身上的灰塵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"起來，坐到寶座上！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被擄的少女錫安啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卸去你頸上的鎖鏈！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["耶和華說：「你們被賣未得分文，你們被贖回也不需分文。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["主耶和華說：「起先我的子民到埃及寄居，後來亞述人無緣無故地欺壓他們。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["耶和華說：「如今，我這裡還有什麼呢？我的子民白白地被擄去，轄制他們的人咆哮大叫，我的名整天被褻瀆。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["然而，我的子民終會認識我的名。到那日，他們就會知道是我對他們說的，看啊，是我。」"]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"那穿山越嶺之人的腳蹤是何等佳美！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他帶來佳音，報告平安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"傳遞喜訊，宣揚救恩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"對錫安說：「你的上帝做王了。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"聽啊，你的守望者高聲呼喊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們在一同歡呼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華回到錫安的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必親眼看見。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷的荒場啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要一同歡呼歌唱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華安慰了祂的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"救贖了耶路撒冷。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華向萬國施展祂的聖臂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"普天下將看見我們上帝的救恩。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"離開吧，離開吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"離開巴比倫吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要沾染不潔之物。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們抬耶和華器具的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要從那裡出來，保持潔淨。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們不用匆忙離開，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不用奔逃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華必走在你們前面，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的上帝必作你們的後盾。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，我的僕人行事睿智，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必被提升，受到尊崇，升為至高。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"許多人看見祂就詫異，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的面容毀得不成人樣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的樣貌傷得不成人形。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必洗淨許多國家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"君王必因祂而閉口無言。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們將看見未曾聽過的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"明白聞所未聞的事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/52.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/53.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/51.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}